  "brief": "LONA briefing  2026-08-27 21:41 UTC\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nWORTH A LOOK\r\n  The breakout book is +75% deployed against a backtested average of 16%.\r\n      Broad strength like this is when the rule earns most of its return and also when it takes its worst drawdowns - everything it holds falls together.\r\n      breakout.deployed = +75%\r\n\r\nWHAT THE RULES DID\r\n  7 new breakout(s) fired today.\r\n      breakout.count = 15  ·  breakout.new_today = 7  ·  breakout.deployed = +75%\r\n  The carry book got richer: mean yield moved +1370.9 bp since yesterday.\r\n      Still gross of the hedge. Finding 012 showed this number is only worth what the spot leg costs to hold.\r\n      carry.mean_yield.change_1d = +1370.9 bp  ·  carry.mean_yield = +34.86%\r\n\r\nCONTEXT\r\n  Carry book is 4 legs at +34.86% a year, gross.\r\n      That is what funding pays, not what the trade returns. Finding 012 showed the same yield turning negative once the spot hedge is charged for, so this number is only worth what the hedge is worth. Nothing here has measured this account's actual borrow cost or basis slippage.\r\n      carry.legs = 4  ·  carry.mean_yield = +34.86%\r\n  Fear and Greed reads 71 - greed.\r\n      Recorded for later testing. LONA has not established that this index predicts anything, so it informs no rule.\r\n      sentiment.fear_greed = 71\r\n  The breakout book is narrower than yesterday by 1 market(s).\r\n      breakout.count.change_1d = -1  ·  breakout.count = 15\r\n  Biggest moves in the universe since yesterday: ENA +20.49%, LIT +12%, TRUMP +11.79%.\r\n      ENA.mark.move_1d = +20.49%  ·  LIT.mark.move_1d = +12%  ·  TRUMP.mark.move_1d = +11.79%\r\n",
